ics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NGS principles"},{"text":"Library-preparation concepts"},{"text":"Sequencing QC"},{"text":"Variant analysis"},{"text":"RNA-seq"}]},{"type":"p","text":"All wet-lab techniques should be learned under appropriate institutional supervision and approved SOPs."}]},{"heading":"Computational research skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"flow","items":["Linux","Python/R","statistics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python fundamentals"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"Biopython"},{"text":"Matplotlib"}]},{"type":"h","text":"R"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data frames"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"ggplot2"},{"text":"Bioconductor ecosystem"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Linux"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Command line"},{"text":"File systems"},{"text":"Shell scripting"},{"text":"Permissions"},{"text":"Package management"},{"text":"Running analysis pipelines"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Reproducibility"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Git/GitHub"},{"text":"Nextflow"},{"text":"Snakemake"},{"text":"Environment management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This becomes particularly important when working with large genomics datasets."},{"type":"h","text":"Research quality and ethics"},{"type":"p","text":"A professional research associate should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research integrity"},{"text":"Data integrity"},{"text":"Reproducibility"},{"text":"Sample traceability"},{"text":"Laboratory documentation"},{"text":"Research ethics"},{"text":"Statistical validity"},{"text":"Appropriate data handling"},{"text":"Authorship principles"},{"text":"Research misconduct"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For human or clinical research, additional requirements may apply, including appropriate ethics approval, informed consent and p